	(text "MONOLITH PRODUCTION BOARD - SHEET INDEX\n2.  Cells and Gauge:  welded 4S pack pads, BQ40Z50-R2 gauge, protection FETs, BQ294700 + F102 second-level protection, SMBus pogo pads\n3.  3V3 Rail:  TPS62177 always-on 3V3\n4.  MCU:  CC2340R5MODA, Tag-Connect TC2030-NL SWD pads\n5.  USB Port 1  /  6.  USB Port 2  (one sheet file):  TPS25751D + TPD4S201 + BQ25756 + TPS62933 per port\nRails (power symbols): PACK_P, 3V3, GND, CELL_N (gauge VSS only)\nSpec and open items: Production/README.md.  Derived from the dev board rev A8 (DevBoard/, history in DevBoard/README.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "17ac7dae-221c-4f1f-bf54-587de0440efb")
	)
	(text "REVISION LOG\nP0  2026-10-17  Dev board rev A8 with the dev-only parts removed (Production/tools/make_production.py, tidy_production.py):\n                sleep-current section, bench supply, cell holders, headers, buttons, status LED, test points, DNP options\n                and 0R links. Added pack wire pads, gauge pogo pads, TC2030-NL SWD pads, factory test pads.\n                Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: none yet.\nDev board history (A0-A8): DevBoard/README.md and the DevBoard root sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 265.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d7cdb54-3de0-4b59-85a8-4bcb85a6f6da")
	)
	(text "TPS25751 ADDRESS / DEAD-BATTERY STRAPS (SafeMode)\nPort 1: ADCIN1 tied to its LDO_3V3, ADCIN2 to GND  -> I2C 0x20\nPort 2: ADCIN1 and ADCIN2 to GND                   -> I2C 0x21\nSame SDA/SCL bus (CC2340 I2C0, 100 kHz): gauge BQ40Z50-R2 0x0B"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
